  "short_name": "Russian style Emerald & Diamond Earrings 14K",
  "long_description_raw": "Imperial and elegant. These solid 14k Rose and White gold earrings are created in a Victorian inspired, old Russian style design. 18 beautiful diamonds totaling 1.04cts. encircle stunning rich green emerald measuring 1.30ct. Sturdy french leverback locks provide a secure fit.\nIf you like how this Russian Jewelry looks in the picture then you will be blown away when you try it on for the first time. \nThis is a brand new item and is manufactured on our premises in New York City Diamond District.\n Item will be shipped within 4-5 business days after payment is cleared.\nAvailable in any Stone you Like Please ask for the Price,\nA Company Appraisal Is Included With Your Purchase.\nAGI Appraisal Available: Value $3,100.00 + $75\n Retail Replacement and Appraisal Value $3,100.00 \nНаши телефоны: 1.800.548. 0411. - 1 917.488.1146 Приём заказов круглосуточно\nпо телефону или через Интернет.\nДоставка товара в любой уголок России, где есть почта. Срок доставки зависит от удалённости региона.\n100% Satisfaction Guaranteed.\nOur Warranty: A full year on workmanship!",
